# REST

### Admin Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "email": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/profile
Authorization: Bearer <your_admin_token_here>

### User Login
POST http://localhost:9092/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv USER_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:9092/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "user",
    "email": "{{$processEnv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/user/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv USER_EMAIL}}"
}

### Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer <your_user_token_here>